---
import "../styles/global.css";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
</head>

<html>
  <main>
    <section class="gauche">
      <div class="texte">
        <h2>Mémoires ouvrières</h2>
        <p>
          Circulez parmi les témoignages sonores recueillis en 1984-1985 par
          Jean-Paul Goux, accompagnés de documents iconographiques.
        </p>
        <a href="#" class="lien"
          ><img src="/public/icones/fleche-goux.svg" alt="" /><h3>
            Découvrez les thématiques
          </h3>
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="button">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="lucide lucide-arrow-right"
            ><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg
          ><h3>Découvrir la carte</h3>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="cover"></div>
    </section>
    <section class="droite">
      <div class="texte">
        <h2 class="italique">Mémoires de l'Enclave</h2>
        <p>
          Découvrez comment <i>Mémoires de l’Enclave</i> a été conçu et réalisé par
          son auteur, puis reçu par le public.
        </p>
        <a href="/chapitres/biographie" class="lien"
          ><img src="/public/icones/fleche-goux.svg" alt="" /><h3>
            Biographie
          </h3>
        </a>
        <a href="/chapitres" class="lien">
          <img src="/public/icones/fleche-goux.svg" alt="" /><h3>
            La fabrique des <i>Mémoires de l'Enclave</i>
          </h3>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="cover2"></div>
    </section>
  </main>
</html>

<style scoped>
  main {
    display: flex;
  }
  .texte {
    font-family: var(--titres-font);
    margin-left: 80px;
    margin-bottom: 175px;
    height: 40%;

    z-index: 100;

    color: white;

    a {
      color: white;
    }
  }

  .italique,
  i {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .italique {
    font-size: 68px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .gauche {
    background-color: #f0f0f0;
    width: 50%;
    height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    position: relative;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  .cover {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    background-image: url("/images/0466.jpg");
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: 70%;
  }
  .cover2 {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    position: absolute;
    font-size: var(--legende-font-size);
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    background-image: url("/images/GOU_P23-03_02-P.jpg");
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: 10%;
  }
  .cover2::after,
  .cover::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(22, 22, 22, 0.4) 0%,
      rgba(22, 22, 22, 1) 100%
    );
    opacity: 0.85;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .droite {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    width: 50%;
    height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    position: relative;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  a > img {
    color: black;
    fill: red;
  }

  h2 {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 72px;
    line-height: 80px;
    width: 70%;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 30px;
    width: 55%;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }
  .lien {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    gap: 15px;

    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;

    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .lien img {
    fill: white;
    color: white;
  }

  .button {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    gap: 15px;

    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 18px;

    background: #e22b40;
    color: white;
    margin-top: 10px;

    width: fit-content;
    padding: 15px 25px;

    transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;

    svg {
      color: white;
      width: 25px;
      height: 25px;

      transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
    }
  }
  .button:hover {
    color: #e22b40;
    background: var(--secondary-color);
    svg {
      color: #e22b40;
    }
  }
</style>
